  "finalText": "The **Boop!** intro is built: 5 s, 1080×1080, 60 fps, cream background. I checked it on a contact sheet at six times, and the idle wiggle is the part I couldn't confirm from stills.\n\n- **Candy shapes:** 8 of them (**Pink circle**, **Yellow star**, **Teal square**, **Purple circle**, **Orange star**, **Blue square**, **Green circle**, **Pink star**) drop in from above, staggered every 0.15 s. Each lands with a stretch-then-squash spring. They sit around the edges and keep a gentle bob or tilt afterwards.\n- **Letters:** **B**, **o**, **o**, **p** and **!** are each a different candy colour in heavy Inter. They launch up from below, stretched tall, and settle with a bouncy spring, one every 0.2 s from 2.0 s.\n- **Idle wiggle:** from about 3.4 s the letters ease into a playful rotation wobble, each one offset from the next, and the shapes keep their small sways until the end.\n\n- **No jostling:** the shapes don't bump or push each other. They land at separate spots and only bounce on their own.\n- **Not run:** I skipped the critique pass.\n\nI can add jostle hits where the shapes collide, make the letter bounce bigger, or swap in a rounder font such as Fredoka if you want."
